# The model picker's account row leads to Claude's accounts, where a sign-in
# asks for the browser's code: one stopped with an unfinished code leaves the
# accounts as they were, and the right code adds the account, selected with its
# limits, while Codex keeps its own selection. The picker then offers Claude's
# models with the new account's limits.
# iOS: testSimulatorAddsClaudeAccountAndKeepsCodexSelected, testSimulatorGoesBackFromAccountLoginAndCanStartAgain (Claude), testSimulatorSignsInDirectlyFromModelSettings
expect "何に取り組みますか？" 30000
press モデル
expect "Fixture Model" 20000
press "Fixture Model" after モデルを検索
press "Claude Code"
press アカウントと週間残量
expect "未ログイン" 10000
press アカウントを追加
expect "2. 認証コードを貼り付け" 15000
type 認証コード "unfinished-code"
press サインインを中止
expect_absent "2. 認証コードを貼り付け" 10000
expect_absent "claude@example.invalid"
press アカウントを追加
type 認証コード "fixture-code#fixture-only" 15000
press サインインを完了
expect "claude@example.invalidを選択中" 20000
expect "Fable · 週間枠 残り 66%" 10000
screenshot claude-added
press Codex
expect "desktop@example.invalidを選択中" 10000
press 閉じる
# Browsing an agent did not change the draft: choose Claude explicitly.
press "Fixture Model"
press "Claude Code"
press "Default (recommended)" after モデルを検索
expect "Fable · 週間枠" 10000
expect Fable
